cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Orbeex in your research or product, please cite it as below."
title: "Orbeex"
abstract: >-
  Orbeex is an open-source, AI-native Geographic Information System (GIS) written in Rust.
  It turns natural language into reviewable, reversible, auditable geospatial operations
  executed by a high-performance native engine, with multi-LLM support and zero vendor lock-in.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
license-url: "https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/orbeex/orbeex"
keywords:
  - gis
  - geospatial
  - rust
  - ai
  - llm
  - agentic
authors:
  - name: "The Orbeex Contributors"
version: "0.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-17"
